[
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0607",
    "en": " ...Well, you cast your line, and now{SAUT}I'm hooked. Please, tell me...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0608",
    "en": "Oooh! Excellent move! That one was{SAUT}incredible!{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0609",
    "en": "{PAGE}If you showed me more things like that,{SAUT}I wouldn't need to know!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0610",
    "en": "   Wh-What the!? What in tarnation are you{SAUT}yelling for!?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0611",
    "en": "  Th-That wasn't it...? Sorry, didn't mean{SAUT}to be suspicious. Will you keep going?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0612",
    "en": "Hoho. You're like a carriage horse.{SAUT}Being dedicated is a good thing.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0613",
    "en": "   Why...? Nothing good comes from living{SAUT}a rebellious life.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0614",
    "en": "  That makes me happy. You look like a{SAUT}lie, but you're a good kid.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0615",
    "en": "   Hmph! You have all the free time in the{SAUT}world! If you don't want to, say so!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0616",
    "en": "   Ho, ho! Then let's negotiate!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0617",
    "en": "  I'm not so much a demon as I am a{SAUT}[FFF0]...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0618",
    "en": " I happen to be on a stroll too.{SAUT}I think you and I could get along.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0619",
    "en": " It's too late now. No sense cryin' over{SAUT}spilt milk.{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0620",
    "en": "{PAGE}Be careful next time.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0621",
    "en": " What are you complaining about? It's{SAUT}first come, first serve for things like{SAUT}this.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0622",
    "en": " Ahhhh! Stop it! It's gonna stink like{SAUT}humans...! Noooo, it's done for!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0623",
    "en": " Hey! That's a child's answer! Don't toy{SAUT}with me!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0624",
    "en": "   Is that so!? That's downright cruel!{SAUT}But I want to eat it too...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0625",
    "en": "   ...I don't get it...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0626",
    "en": "   The more ya have to suck out, the more{SAUT}flavorful it gets! That's dried squid!{SAUT}Delicious, I say!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0627",
    "en": "Hey! My teeth ain't what they used to{SAUT}be! I can't eat such hard food!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0628",
    "en": "  I don't need that.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0629",
    "en": " Hey! It's obvious ya don't wanna!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0630",
    "en": "  That's right. Now there's a good{SAUT}attitude.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0631",
    "en": " If you're just gonna ignore me, why'd{SAUT}you answer my first question!? I don't{SAUT}understand...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0632",
    "en": " Ho ho. You young'uns don't understand{SAUT}the emotion of a moonless night.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0633",
    "en": " A moonless night makes surprise attacks{SAUT}easy... You're plannin' somethin'...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0634",
    "en": "   That's really strange. You and I both{SAUT}have more to learn.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0635",
    "en": "  ...I've never played this game you're{SAUT}goin' on about...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0636",
    "en": "...I've heard of that before, but{SAUT}where...?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0637",
    "en": "You're mischief. You don't have to tease{SAUT}me, do ya? Come on, do somethin'.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0638",
    "en": " Argh! You ain't gonna listen!?{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0639",
    "en": "{PAGE}Time to put a rebellious boy in his{SAUT}place!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0640",
    "en": " You're obedient... But after seein'{SAUT}those eyes of yours, I can't trust ya...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0641",
    "en": "   Hey! You're not supposed to interrupt!{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0642",
    "en": "{PAGE}If ya can't wait for someone to finish{SAUT}talkin', I'll have to punish you!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0643",
    "en": "   Ho, ho! How brazenly you speak!{SAUT}Interesting! Let's negotiate.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0644",
    "en": "  I'll give ya the ol' one-two! Don't be{SAUT}talkin' that hogwash!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0645",
    "en": "   ...Oh well.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0646",
    "en": "That's right! Now that I think about it,{SAUT}I feel like we've met before...{ATTENTE}",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0647",
    "en": "{PAGE}Sorry, all you humans look alike...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0648",
    "en": "  Ho, ho! It's just a human. I got all{SAUT}worried over nothin'.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0649",
    "en": " ...Yer really a demon? You smell sorta{SAUT}human...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "KOROU.BIN:text:0650",
